        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Becwaeth">Becw</ref> 2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">7: swa ic hit hæbbe, swa hit se sealde, ðe to syllanne ahte, unbryde 7 unforboden.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And as he gave it who had the power to give, without fraud or prohibition, so I have it.</ab>
